{"text": "I found him in the bushes this morning,\" the woodcutter said. He lay near the mountain road, stabbed once in the chest. The blood was already dry when I saw him. Broken bamboo and marks on the ground showed a fight. I found no sword or bow, only rope and a comb. I saw the couple yesterday at noon, the traveling monk said. He carried a sword and bow, and his wife rode beside him. I caught the famous bandit Tajomaro near the bridge, the constable said. He had fallen off a horse but still had Takahiro's bow. Find the wife and ask her what he did. Takahiro, a kind samurai, married my daughter Masago, the old woman said. She is proud and only 19. Please find her before you send me home without news.", "words": [{"w": " I", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.38, "p": 0.414}, {"w": " found", "start": 0.38, "end": 0.8, "p": 0.62}, {"w": " him", "start": 0.8, "end": 1.1, "p": 0.989}, {"w": " in", "start": 1.1, "end": 1.34, "p": 0.995}, {"w": " the", "start": 1.34, "end": 1.56, "p": 0.997}, {"w": " bushes", "start": 1.56, "end": 1.86, "p": 0.994}, {"w": " this", "start": 1.86, "end": 2.26, "p": 0.995}, {"w": " morning,\"", "start": 2.26, "end": 3.28, "p": 0.653}, {"w": " the", "start": 3.28, "end": 3.62, "p": 0.95}, {"w": " woodcutter", "start": 3.62, "end": 4.18, "p": 0.968}, {"w": " said.", "start": 4.18, "end": 4.66, "p": 0.999}, {"w": " He", "start": 5.72, "end": 5.72, "p": 0.417}, {"w": " lay", "start": 5.72, "end": 6.08, "p": 0.993}, {"w": " near", "start": 6.08, "end": 6.4, "p": 0.995}, {"w": " the", "start": 6.4, "end": 6.66, "p": 0.995}, {"w": " mountain", "start": 6.66, "end": 7.02, "p": 0.985}, {"w": " road,", "start": 7.02, "end": 7.52, "p": 0.988}, {"w": " stabbed", "start": 7.9, "end": 8.26, "p": 0.985}, {"w": " once", "start": 8.26, "end": 8.78, "p": 0.994}, {"w": " in", "start": 8.78, "end": 9.0, "p": 0.991}, {"w": " the", "start": 9.0, "end": 9.2, "p": 0.998}, {"w": " chest.", "start": 9.2, "end": 9.62, "p": 1.0}, {"w": " The", "start": 10.4, "end": 10.62, "p"